<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>通用 AI 正在替学生把作业写完</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C9DBF5' }}>01 · PROBLEM</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 581, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 400, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 568, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 568, height: 120, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>学习过程被替代</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>拿到的是答案，不是排查思路；下次遇到同类问题仍不会处理。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 568, height: 120, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>幻觉无法核对</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>看似合理的函数名与参数，学生没有能力判别真伪。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 568, height: 120, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>脱离课程实际</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>解法常超出已讲授范围，与教材、实验手册不一致。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 568, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', background: '#F7F9FC', paddingLeft: 26, paddingRight: 26, paddingTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>我们的定位</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>面向高校软件工程实训的 RAG 智能答疑知识库</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          · 只依据课程资料作答<br />
          · 每条结论附可点开的引用<br />
          · 资料没有就明确说没有<br />
          · 不给可直接提交的完整实现
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 74, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 22, paddingRight: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>一句话差异：通用 AI 帮你抄作业，我们只给可溯源提示，让思考真正发生。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
